  "description": "The Vitus Dee 29 VR is an aluminium, smooth-rolling, big-wheel urban bike.\n\nUse it to commute or cruise around town and be confident it can tackle road or off-road sections with ease. Designed with practicality and comfort in mind, the Dee 29 VR features front and rear mudguard mounts, as well as rear pannier mounts.\n\nThis utility bike features hydraulic disc brakes and 160mm rotors front and rear for improved stopping in urban areas, and all-weathers. It has a reliable 3 speed Shimano internal hub drivetrain with a single chainring to keep things nice and simple for easy maintenance\n\nThe large, quick release 29er wheels provide efficient rolling over rough roads and off-road trails. WTB Nano tyres provide just the right amount of grip for tackling almost anything you can throw at them, whilst still having a tarmac friendly rolling resistance for effort-free cruising\n\nUtility cycling at its best.",
